%%{init: {'theme': 'neutral'}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> ISSUE: AR/AW accepted
    ISSUE --> ISSUE: beat < len
    ISSUE --> WAIT_RSP: beat == len
    WAIT_RSP --> AGGREGATE: all sub-responses in
    AGGREGATE --> IDLE: one B / RLAST upstream

    note left of IDLE
        Latch addr, len, size, burst
        on the accepted command.
    end note
    note right of ISSUE
        next_address by burst type:
          FIXED  addr
          INCR   addr + (1 << size)
          WRAP   wrap in ((len+1) << size)
    end note
    note right of AGGREGATE
        ONE AXI4 response for the whole
        burst, worst response wins.
    end note
